{"candidateAnswer":"build an indoor obstacle course for interactive play with his dog","evidence":"[D10:12 | 8:32 pm on 3 July, 2023] Andrew: Lately I've been finding new hobbies since I can't hike. I've been getting into cooking more and trying out new recipes - it's been enjoyable. Do you enjoy cooking? Any favorite recipes?\n[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?","itemId":"urn:uuid:1dd02e0c-7245-5f2e-846c-ef7d1a1ad80b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d344620e2802fbae0735c6eba5e48447da69c6200dd95ec720e99d0dc188b692","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is an indoor activity that Andrew would enjoy doing while make his dog happy?","referenceAnswer":"cook dog treats","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d344620e2802fbae0735c6eba5e48447da69c6200dd95ec720e99d0dc188b692"}}]}